---
description: 
globs: *.ts,*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use api backend routes from shared/routes object
- Use @reduxjs/toolkit approach for state management
- Use baseApi.injectEndpoints instead of createApi
- Set QueryTag for different provided tags with names that repeat the entity
- Use providesListTag fabric for generating cache tags
- Use descriptive query names: workspaces instead of getWorkspaces
- Show snackbar notifications for success mutations
- Show snackbar notifications for errors in mutations and queries
- Use types from shared/api: ApiResponse for single entities, ApiCollectionResponse for collections and ApiError types
- Use isLoading state for queries and show LinearProgress during loading
- Use isLoading state for mutations and disable form buttons or connected controls
- Use RTKQuery hook destructuring for extracting values